WEBVTT

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:31.392
the better off we all are.

00:04:32.768 --> 00:04:35.187
But we haven't always seen
the world this way.

00:04:36.522 --> 00:04:38.691
For the five years
before I joined Instagram,

00:04:38.733 --> 00:04:40.985
I was the head of News Feed at Facebook.

00:04:41.027 --> 00:04:44.655
I was in that role during
the US presidential election in 2016.

00:04:44.697 --> 00:04:47.074
I was in that role
during Cambridge Analytica.

00:04:47.074 --> 00:04:50.870
I traveled around the world,
talking to publishers and policymakers,

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:54.457
most of whom took the time to tell me
everything that we were doing wrong.

00:04:55.666 --> 00:04:58.252
I'm sure some of you
hold my company and me

00:04:58.294 --> 00:05:00.629
personally accountable
for all sorts of things.